      "id": "ablate",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 45,
      "y": 1125,
      "width": 1600,
      "height": 115,
      "fontSize": 23,
      "text": "One treatment per experiment\nPlanning: selective slicing vs global warm start.   Wake policy: events vs polling.   Routing: equivalent allowed operations.\nAblate query-set tracking, semantic revalidation, and dependency precision on frozen cases.\nMemory and notification usefulness need separate checks; subjective judgments are reported separately.",
      "originalText": "One treatment per experiment\nPlanning: selective slicing vs global warm start.   Wake policy: events vs polling.   Routing: equivalent allowed operations.\nAblate query-set tracking, semantic revalidation, and dependency precision on frozen cases.\nMemory and notification usefulness need separate checks; subjective judgments are reported separately.",
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
