      "id": "footer",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 45,
      "y": 1285,
      "width": 1600,
      "height": 55,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "text": "Proposed evaluation • no measurements. Do not present a scripted demo as a benchmark or claim superiority from a graph alone.\nCredit shared platform protections to the platform. Our contribution must survive equally equipped baselines.",
